 {
  "lib": "Internal",
  "num": 201,
  "name": "",
  "type": "field",
  "text": "Who is West End Post Interactive?\n\n\u2022 Steve Ewing - Manager, Interactive Projects\n\u2022 Faith Jackson - Public Relations, Marketing\n\u2022 Paul Roberts / Carol Harris - Sales\n\u2022 James Marzano - Interactive Producer\n\u2022 Mark Lennan - Graphic Artist\n\u2022 Tim Smith - Consultant, Programmer"
 },
 {
  "lib": "Internal",
  "num": 202,
  "name": "",
  "type": "field",
  "text": "What is West End Post Interactive?\n\n\u2022 a unique combination of \"new media\"\n   talent and a successful film/video production\n   and post house now offering interactive\n   multimedia solutions to communication\n   challenges."
 },
 {
  "lib": "Internal",
  "num": 203,
  "name": "",
  "type": "field",
  "text": "Who to Contact?\n\n"
 },
 {
  "lib": "Internal",
  "num": 204,
  "name": "",
  "type": "field",
  "text": "What Next?\n\n\u2022 Interactive media is the next step.  Seize the\n   opportunity and get a more complete picture\n   of all that interactive media can do for your \n   communication challenge."
 },
 {
  "lib": "Internal",
  "num": 205,
  "name": "",
  "type": "field",
  "text": "How Did We Do This?\n\n\u2022 The programming for this demo was \n   executed in MacroMind Director by \n   Tim Smith .   Graphic elements were \n   created using Adobe Photoshop, Adobe       \n   Illustrator, and Infini-D by Tim Smith, \n   James Marzano , and Mark Lennan ."
 },
